{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ZRbaeaRYbX1792965817.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>警方在旺角一幢唐樓掃毒，一名男子逃避追捕時懷疑從天台墮地身亡。</p><p></p><p>現場消息指，警方在掃毒行動中拘捕20多人，檢獲毒品數量有待點算。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FALLEN-0400_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026rdKtJzfXRB1792965812.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>警方指，有組織罪案及三合會調查科探員昨晚約九時，突擊搜查新填地街一個懷疑是毒窟的唐樓單位。一名42歲本地男子逃避追捕，懷疑由天台墮地昏迷，送廣華醫院搶救後證實不治。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FALLEN-0400_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026DuyVCH5GDU1792965814.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:41.194935+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T21:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:04.606350+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:25.891626+00:00","content_hash":"09447060e3db34038fc4693d3f66e2f9e277388c7500cbe26cbd794ee7949923","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:41.194935+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}